      "id": 1,
      "text": "McKay is an unincorporated rural community in Umatilla County, located about six miles south of Pendleton along McKay Creek.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/McKay%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community is named after Dr. William Cameron McKay, a physician and trader of Scottish-Ojibwa and Chinook descent.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        5,
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
