      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/McKay%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The area encompassing McKay was historically part of the traditional territory of the Cayuse people.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
